n                    </span>\n                    <a aria-label=\"فتح الواجب: حفظ الأت 8 الاولى من سورة العلق\" class=\"flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-[22px] text-[var(--wine)] hover:bg-[var(--sand)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-5\" data-name=\"second assignment open link\" href=\"https://abo-zeyd.github.io/myClass/lessons#islamic-education-surah-al-alaq-item-1d32e32b-image-0\" title=\"فتح الواجب\">\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-external-link\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-5-1\" data-name=\"second assignment external link icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </a>\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-label=\"محتوى القسم الإضافي\" class=\"mt-10 grid gap-x-14 gap-y-8 border-t border-[var(--edge)] pt-8 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(250px,0.68fr)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4\" data-name=\"secondary content section\">\n            <div aria-labelledby=\"activities-title\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"activities subsection\">\n                <div class=\"mb-4 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"activities header\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"activities title group\">\n                        <h2 class=\"m-0 text-xl font-extrabold text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"activities section title\" id=\"activities-title\">\n                            أنشطة داعمة\n                        </h2>\n                        <p class=\"mb-0 mt-1 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"activities description\">\n                            للمراجعة والتدرب\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"activities count label\">\n                        ٢ نشاط\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <ul class=\"m-0 list-none divide-y divide-[var(--edge)] p-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"activities list\">\n                    <li class=\"flex min-h-[56px] items-center gap-3 py-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"first activity row\">\n                        <span class=\"text-lg text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"first activity arrow icon container\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-narrow-left\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"first activity arrow icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                        <p class=\"m-0 min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"first activity title\">\n                            ملخص وأنشطة درس الأعداد الأصغر من 100 000\n                        </p>\n                        <span class=\"shrink-0 rounded bg-[#f5e7c7] px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"first activity type badge\">\n                            للتدرب\n                        </span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex min-h-[56px] items-center gap-3 py-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"second activity row\">\n                        <span class=\"text-lg text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"second activity arrow icon container\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-narrow-left\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"second activity arrow icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                        <p class=\"m-0 min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"second activity title\">\n                            أنشطة تطبيقية أنواع الكلمة\n                        </p>\n                        <span class=\"shrink-0 rounded bg-[#f5e7c7] px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"second activity type badge\">\n                            للتدرب\n                        </span>\n                        <a aria-label=\"فتح نشاط أنواع الكلمة\" class=\"flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-xl text-[var(--wine)] hover:bg-[var(--sand)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"second activity link\" href=\"#\" title=\"فتح النشاط\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-external-link\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"second activity external link icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div aria-labelledby=\"posts-title\" class=\"md:border-r md:border-[var(--edge)] md:pr-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"posts subsection\">\n                <h2 class=\"m-0 text-xl font-extrabold text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"posts section title\" id=\"posts-title\">\n                    منشورات القسم\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"mb-0 mt-1 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"posts description\">\n                    التوزيع الزمني والإعلانات المصورة\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"mt-4 flex min-h-[72px] items-center gap-3 border-y border-[var(--edge)] py-4 text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-3\" data-name=\"posts empty state container\">\n                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-photo-off text-xl text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-3-1\" data-name=\"photo off icon\">\n                    </i>\n                    <p class=\"m-0 text-sm leading-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-3-2\" data-name=\"posts empty state message\">\n                        لا توجد صور منشورة حالياً.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <footer class=\"border-t border-[var(--edge)] bg-[var(--surface)] px-6 py-5 text-center text-sm text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-3\" data-name=\"footer container\">\n        <p class=\"m-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\" data-name=\"copyright text\">\n            © ٢٠٢٦ قسم السنة الرابعة - الأستاذ عز الدين عويسي. جميع الحقوق محفوظة.\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"mb-0 mt-1 text-xs\" data-kid=\"1-3-2\" data-name=\"platform description text\">\n            منصة تعليمية لدعم وتوجيه تلاميذ التعليم الابتدائي\n        </p>\n    </footer>\n</div>\n",
